NOTICE -- Vendored WiCE corpus subset
=====================================

This directory (eval/__fixtures__/wice-vendored/) contains a vendored subset of the
WiCE (Entailment in the Wild) dataset. WiCE is the ONLY corpus this repository
commits, because it is the only eval corpus whose license permits redistribution
(per phase decision D-04). AVeriTeC (CC-BY-NC-4.0) and LLM-AggreFact (CC-BY-ND-4.0)
are NOT vendored anywhere under eval/ -- they are fetch-only, and the committed
manifest carries only their example IDs, remapped labels, pinned revision, and
sha256 checksums (never the raw corpus text).

